"- So first, I scanned Bobby’s head with Heges\\.\n\t- First scan was mostly okay, and is probably the best, but there’s stray floating geometry\n\t\t- Also the backs of the ears don’t work well, because they’re thin enough that it can’t figure them out\n\n![](dayone-moment://F78795E936CF42C890B20214A580ED09)\n\n![](dayone-moment://6FE547630952479B80349ADF1449E3CD)\n\n\t- Second scan, eyes closed, was worse\n\t- Bobby figured out that the floating nose bit was probably the result of starting on the left side, then going around the back to get the full head scan, then doing the face at the end\n\t\t- I think the takeaway might be that I need to do a really good face shot and a really good full head thing, and put them together in post\n\n![](dayone-moment://48C8D25E42944BDAA9E7E1BD5341CBB1)\n\n- Then we tried a body scan with Polycam\n\n![](dayone-moment://A13339B1DE0C48C1BF4FA48DA14307F7)\n\n\t- Face was a mess, hands were a mess, rest was\\.\\.\\. a little less of a mess\\. \n\t- The rest was imperfect, but workable\\. Clear enough that it’s pants and a shirt, even if the textures could maybe use some adjusting to fix the seams\n- Then we tried hand scanning\n\t- Tried a couple different ways \\- him holding hands out in a couple positions, etc\\.\n\n![](dayone-moment://5061DDAC90AC4EF1B732C19EC1A453F7)\n\n![](dayone-moment://8EA90614AB9A4F7CA561B126A1134F1F)\n\n\t- Finally just went over to a table and scanned each side separately\\. We’ll see if we can stitch those together\n\n![](dayone-moment://CA43E301B9E143EA94E58B3096DA242D)\n\n![](dayone-moment://248C3939B20D42FE9A9AAFD8DBF71B9F)\n\n\t- Original plan had been to scan both hands, but I was tired of that cannoli after a couple scans so we just did one\n\t- Part of the issue is that it loses tracking when crossing over the edge of the hand \\- not enough detail\n\t- I have enough partial scans though that maybe I can make use of some of them for the arms\\. Dunno\\.\n- Oh cannoli I forgot to get some good photos of his glasses\\. And maybe his eyes\\.\n- I had a couple random thoughts after the fact\n\t- Tried the “take photos and send em to be photogrammetried on the cloud” approach to a hand\\.\n\t\t- It went terribly\n\n![](dayone-moment://38E1272784AF4198AE68560C61E7F8B3)\n\n\t- This morning I realized I could scan myself by moving my head instead of the phone\n\t\t- And it went well for me\n\n![](dayone-moment://8670A1CDD4114DE485265DA4DD75637C)\n\n\t\t- So I tried it with Bobby\n\t\t- It didn’t work well for him\\. We tried twice\\.\n\n![](dayone-moment://709E2A0F61BF402189569DFD4CB365C4)\n\n![](dayone-moment://AE945A21AAB342D5B69BB38720725789)\n\n- Bobby left, perhaps to go down to the other area he works now"
